        {
            "id": "CAP3_PAJAROS_01",
            "text": "Crossroads guard! Nobody move."
        },
        {
            "id": "CAP3_PAJAROS_02",
            "text": "They're only birds…"
        },
        {
            "id": "CAP3_PAJAROS_03",
            "text": "Birds that aren't for sale. Tie them up."
        },
        {
            "id": "CAP3_PAJAROS_04",
            "text": "There. Fly."
        },
        {
            "id": "CAP3_PAJAROS_05",
            "text": "You warned us instead of throwing punches. That, kid, is the hard part."
        },
        {
            "id": "CAP3_PAJAROS_06",
            "text": "If you're going to the Forbidden Forest, go by day. And don't touch anything that glows."
        },
        {
            "id": "CAP3_PAJAROS_07",
            "text": "Thanks. I will."
        },
        {
            "id": "CAP3_JAULAS_01",
            "text": "It's over…"
        },
        {
            "id": "CAP3_JAULAS_02",
            "text": "The cages… no, no, no."
        },
        {
            "id": "CAP3_JAULAS_03",
            "text": "We saw the smoke from the crossroads."
        },
        {
            "id": "CAP3_JAULAS_04",
            "text": "Three cages burnt. The other birds will make it."
        },
        {
            "id": "CAP3_JAULAS_05",
            "text": "Warning us would have been enough, kid."
        },
        {
            "id": "CAP3_JAULAS_06",
            "text": "I know."
        },
        {
            "id": "CAP3_JAULAS_07",
            "text": "Go to the Forbidden Forest by day. And think before you burn."
        },
